cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the WSSC paper and this repository."
title: "weight-skills: zero-token procedural skills for local LLMs"
abstract: >-
  A runtime for compiling agent procedures into low-rank weight cartridges and
  mounting them into frozen foundation models at inference time, eliminating
  system-prompt prefill cost without modifying base weights.
